    "id": "N028V/zero_sum",
    "family": "zero_sum",
    "prompt": "Write Python function solve. Return the maximum length of a contiguous subarray whose sum is zero, or 0 if none.\nReturn only the complete function after any thinking. Do not import modules.",
    "solution": "def solve(xs):\n    first={0:-1}\n    total=best=0\n    for i,x in enumerate(xs):\n        total+=x\n        if total in first: best=max(best,i-first[total])\n        else: first[total]=i\n    return best",
